<p>Maa aa gayi hussain&nbsp;<br> Maa aa gayi hussain</p> 
<p>Kitni tapish hai beta<br> Saaya tera banau<br> Aakhir hussain maa hu</p> 
<p>Naazo ke paale beta<br> Aa jholi mai phailau<br> Aakhir Hussain maa hu</p> 
<p>1. Nana ne kabr chodi, aaye ali najaf se<br> Mai aa gayi bakaiyya se, aye laal paas tere<br> Bachche ka gham mai apne kyu dil se na lagau</p> 
<p>2. Jhoole me chayn tumko, milta nahi tha beta<br> Maine kabhi ali ne, godi me hi sulaya<br> aa jao phir se tumko aagosh me sulau</p> 
<p>3. Jibreel sa farsihta, jhoola jhulane aaya<br> Le le ke jaam e kausar, pani pilane aaya<br> Bachpan ke laad tere mai kaise bhool jau</p> 
<p>4. Kehti rahi mai zalim, naazo ka hai yeh pala<br> Khanjar chala na uspe, ahmed ka hai dulara<br> Sar aa gaya sina pe mai kaise chayn paau</p> 
<p>5. Naaka nabi the jiska, laash uski kya yahi hai<br> Ghodo ke daudne se, pamaal ho chuki hai<br> Tukde utha utha ke lasha tera banau</p> 
<p>6. Hai bekafan janaza, jalti hui zamee'n par<br> Roti rahengi maa bhi, ta hashr ab yahi par<br> Tanha tujhe yaha par mai kaise chod jaau</p> 
<p>7. Akbar ke dil se barchi, beta jo tune khainchi<br> Sine ka uske khoo'n mai, haatho se rokti thi<br> Woh mar gaya tadap ke kis tarha bhool jau</p> 
<p>8. Mayyat ho jiske ghar pe, dete hai log pursa<br> Kitni ghareeb hai yeh, ujdi hui teri maa<br> Lene ko tera pursa ghar ghar me roti jaau</p> 
<p>9. Royi lahad pe zehra, maqtal me royi zehra<br> Rota hai jo bhi tujhpe, karti hu saath girya<br> Rote hue hasan se nauha tera likhau</p>